/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 242 0 R
/T (The partnership between Logitech G and G2 Esports is based on a shared commitment to competitive performance, innovation, and the continuous development of professional esports. Having worked together for several years, the relationship has evolved beyond a standard hardware sponsorship into a collaborative partnership where G2's players and creators contribute to testing and improving Logitech G products.  Rather than focusing only on product promotion, the collaboration integrates Logitech G into G2's competitive ecosystem. Players use the equipment in training and competition, while also participating in product development and content creation. This creates authenticity because the products are presented as essential performance tools rather than marketing placements.  From a marketing perspective, the partnership reinforces G2's image as a high-performance esports organization while positioning Logitech G as a brand trusted by professional players. The collaboration also creates opportunities for engaging content, product launches, player setup videos, and community activations that provide value beyond simple sponsorship exposure. Overall, the Logitech G partnership illustrates how esports sponsorships can become innovation partnerships. By combining professional feedback, authentic product integration, and fan-focused content, G2 and Logitech G create a relationship that benefits players, the community, and both brands while strengthening their credibility within the esports industry.)
/E (The partnership between Logitech G and G2 Esports is based on a shared commitment to competitive performance, innovation, and the continuous development of professional esports. Having worked together for several years, the relationship has evolved beyond a standard hardware sponsorship into a collaborative partnership where G2's players and creators contribute to testing and improving Logitech G products.  Rather than focusing only on product promotion, the collaboration integrates Logitech G into G2's competitive ecosystem. Players use the equipment in training and competition, while also participating in product development and content creation. This creates authenticity because the products are presented as essential performance tools rather than marketing placements.  From a marketing perspective, the partnership reinforces G2's image as a high-performance esports organization while positioning Logitech G as a brand trusted by professional players. The collaboration also creates opportunities for engaging content, product launches, player setup videos, and community activations that provide value beyond simple sponsorship exposure. Overall, the Logitech G partnership illustrates how esports sponsorships can become innovation partnerships. By combining professional feedback, authentic product integration, and fan-focused content, G2 and Logitech G create a relationship that benefits players, the community, and both brands while strengthening their credibility within the esports industry.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
